{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14326010","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14326010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1432601001:1":{"text":"페리엘이 손수 심은 꽃이 천천히 자라고 있다.\n씨앗을 심은 순간이 방금 전처럼 생생하면서도, 오래된 일처럼 느껴진다...","source_cn":"斐利尔亲手种下的花，在缓缓生长。\\n埋下种子的时刻仿佛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D7AB3F3499D7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1432601002:1":{"text":"페리엘, 그거 알아? 네가 심은 환영의 꽃이 산들바람에 입을 맞추고 새벽 이슬을 마시며 햇살과 장난치고 있어...","source_cn":"斐利尔，你知道吗？你种下的幻影花亲吻过轻风，啜饮过晨露...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x114F48389DC1FF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}